      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, first statement",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Delivered</li>\n<li>\n<p>to the hand of Mu\u02bfallim Mas\u0323lih\u0323 the Jew, mentioned on the&nbsp;recto, 4,000 nis\u0323f fid\u0323d\u0323a and 500 nis\u0323f fid\u0323d\u0323a as stipulated</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>on the recto of the document, from the hand of the ami\u0304r Siya\u0304vu\u0304sh, formerly the ka\u0304shif of al-Bahnasa\u0304wiyya, by way of the ami\u0304r Qayt\u0323a\u0304s C\u0327avus\u0327,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>who put his name on it on the 13th of the month of S\u0323afar the Good of the lunar year 1060 [14 February 1650].</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
