      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, right column",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Half of it,</li>\n<li>enumerated fi\u1e0d\u1e0da:</li>\n<li>2,257.</li>\n<li>The ami\u0304r Qayt\u0323a\u0304s C\u0327avus\u0327,</li>\n<li>mentioned above,</li>\n<li>was present and witnessed this,</li>\n<li>and verified ...&nbsp;</li>\n<li>and sound ...</li>\n<li>The seal of Qayt\u0323a\u0304s C\u0327avus\u0327</li></ol>\n",
