          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, left column",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>enumerated fi\u1e0d\u1e0da:</li>\n<li>4,515.</li>\n<li>\n<p>Mah\u0323fu\u0304z\u0323 ibn Badr al-Di\u0304n the odac\u0131 (chamberlain)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>was present and witnessed this.</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
