      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, third statement, right column",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>What is [i.e., the amount] in the district of</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Za\u0304wiyat ... in the sub-province of Minu\u0304fiyya &nbsp;from the hand of the ami\u0304r Yazbak, the tax farmer of half</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>of the aforementioned district, represented by [?]25 Shaykh Muh\u0323ammad al-Mas\u0323ri\u0304, by virtue of his property available to the aforementioned Mu\u02bfallim</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Mas\u0323lih\u0323, dated 12 Juma\u0304da\u0304 al-Tha\u0304ni</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>of the lunar year 1060 [11 June 1650],</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>heavy qint\u0323a\u0304rs:</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>110.&nbsp;</p>\n</li></ol>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
