          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, fourth statement, right column",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>What remains of the aforementioned loan</li>\n<li>\n<p>the ami\u0304r Yazbak will pay to the ami\u0304r</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Yu\u0304suf C\u0327elebi, mentioned on the recto,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>heavy qint\u0323a\u0304rs:</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>70.</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
