          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>By virtue of that, everything was ended. [Neither] party is entitled to anything from the other, not little and not much, by those present </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and those who will affix their script to [the document], reg- istered on 18 Juma\u0304da\u0304 [al-]A\u0304khir of the lunar year 1060 [21 June 1650], praise God. </p>\n</li></ol>\n\n",
