          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>His [the judge Ah\u0323mad\u2019s] scribe,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>the poor one Mah\u0323fuz\u0323 ibn</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Badr al-Di\u0304n the odac\u0131 (chamberlain),</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>attended this [session] and witnessed it. </p>\n</li></ol>\n",
